    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7f474541306f39afc2ec3face6c7283d.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7f474541306f39afc2ec3face6c7283d.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7f474541306f39afc2ec3face6c7283d.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200eJoin our Discord Server</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/1d394cbfec5e3e1d428b469666162506.avif?t=1755039379\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Night: The Darkness Within</strong> is a dark, psychological Metroidvania where every breath pulls you deeper into Jake\u2019s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate surreal dreamscapes, confront inner demons, and piece together the fragments of a shattered heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder the truth is to face \u2014 but it\u2019s the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/8cceb4812e6acd8bd5003e53e87b1be3.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/8cceb4812e6acd8bd5003e53e87b1be3.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/8cceb4812e6acd8bd5003e53e87b1be3.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Until you make the unconscious conscious, <strong>it will direct your life and you will call it fate.</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -Carl Gustav Jung</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7ad6aa0e0e97b4c6c4cb7a5afdd351d8.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7ad6aa0e0e97b4c6c4cb7a5afdd351d8.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7ad6aa0e0e97b4c6c4cb7a5afdd351d8.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello there.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019m Jake \u2014 and I\u2019m finally ready to face my inner demons. For a long time, I ran from them. Drowned in sorrow. Did nothing. But enough is enough. It\u2019s time to descend. To face whatever\u2019s waiting in this crazy quantum dream we call reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So\u2026 you coming?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE PLATFORMING MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a platforming experience like no other, featuring fireflies with extraordinary abilities such as horizontal and vertical boosts, teleportation, and gravity manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/d18511db2569df5ced671d98ed029fb6.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/d18511db2569df5ced671d98ed029fb6.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/d18511db2569df5ced671d98ed029fb6.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIERCE COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of smart enemies and tough Bosses, ready to kick your butt!  <br>But, it's also a dream, so your martial arts skills are on point, with moves that flow off of each like your favourite ice cream flavours on a hot summer day! Mmm, delicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can master combat and equip the right gear - like the Flaming Mitts, or the Heavenly Ass-Whooperz, maybe you stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/4c0881bc7e1cf088ac00b5f0d4679ca6.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/4c0881bc7e1cf088ac00b5f0d4679ca6.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/4c0881bc7e1cf088ac00b5f0d4679ca6.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STUNNING ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuff is beautiful....everywhere you look there is beauty, like in a dream that can turn into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Jake to fit your play style. Get the best gear you can, because you will need it, where you are headed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
