NTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuff is beautiful....everywhere you look there is beauty, like in a dream that can turn into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/7120aeef558c208ba83451cc66257784.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Jake to fit your play style. Get the best gear you can, because you will need it, where you are headed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.poster.avif?t=1755039379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.webm?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533140/extras/e810d6452d5f63bae993e507449304c4.mp4?t=1755039379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
